cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "CBAM-U-Net for MRI Motion Artifact Correction"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a physics-informed CBAM-enhanced U-Net for
  retrospective MRI motion artifact correction, together with a stochastic
  k-space perturbation framework that synthesises paired training data from
  the MR-ART repository. Accompanies the paper "Bridging the Gap: Supervised
  MRI Motion Artifact Correction via Data Synthesis: A CBAM-U-Net Approach".
